cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper it implements."
title: KernelOPT
abstract: >-
  Dispatch-aware, agentic GPU-kernel optimization for compiled PyTorch models,
  ninfer CUDA ops, and llama.cpp ggml-cuda kernels. An independent implementation
  of the KernelOPT method (profile -> plan -> edit -> verify -> gate) with a
  four-gate verification cascade.
